        "end_character": 78474
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-094159",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-094159-1b2f98665476e92e",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-094159",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-05",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Government authorities in the US, at the federal, state and local level, and other countries extensively regulate, among other things, the research, development, testing, manufacture, quality control, approval, labeling, packaging, storage, record-keeping, promotion, advertising, distribution, marketing and export and import of products such as those we are developing.",
        "start_character": 87562,
        "end_character": 87933
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-094159",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-094159-1b2f98665476e92e",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-094159",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-05",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In parallel with our clinical development program, we are executing an integrated CMC strategy intended to provide sufficient drug substance and drug product to support the completion of the global HCV Phase 3 development of the bemnifosbuvir and ruzasvir regimen, and, if approved, supply product for commercial launch and subsequent commercial sales.",
        "start_character": 60857,
        "end_character": 61209
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-094159",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-094159-1b2f98665476e92e",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-094159",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-05",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Leveraging our deep understanding of virology, medicinal chemistry and antiviral drug development, we have built a proprietary platform of nucleosides and nucleotides (together “nucleos(t)ides”) to develop novel product candidates to treat single stranded ribonucleic acid (“ssRNA”) viruses, which are a prevalent cause of serious viral diseases.",
        "start_character": 6027,
        "end_character": 6373
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-094159",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-094159-1b2f98665476e92e",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-094159",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-05",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "The commercial opportunity for any product candidate we develop, if any are approved, could be reduced or eliminated if such product fails to achieve market acceptance from patients, prescribers and payors, our competitors develop and commercialize products that are more effective, have fewer or less severe side effects, are more convenient, or are less expensive than any products that we may develop.",
        "start_character": 66236,
        "end_character": 66640
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-094159",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-094159-1b2f98665476e92e",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-094159",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-05",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "The key competitive factors affecting the success of any product candidates that we develop, if approved, are likely to be their efficacy, safety, convenience, price, and the availability of reimbursement from government and other third-party payors.",
        "start_character": 65985,
        "end_character": 66235
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-094159",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-094159-1b2f98665476e92e",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-094159",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-05",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "To assist in the commercialization in the US of any product candidates we successfully develop, we may enter arrangements with third parties that have existing commercial infrastructure including a pharmaceutical sales force and expertise in managed care.",
        "start_character": 64122,
        "end_character": 64377
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-094159",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-094159-1b2f98665476e92e",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-094159",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-05",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Under the terms of the Merck License Agreement, we are obligated to use commercially reasonable efforts to develop and commercialize at least one Product in the Field in certain countries.",
        "start_character": 58541,
        "end_character": 58729
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-094159",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-094159-1b2f98665476e92e",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-094159",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-05",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We are also relying on this expertise as we expand and leverage our proprietary nucleos(t)ide platform in our efforts to discover and develop other innovative product candidates for the treatment of serious viral diseases for which no DAAs are approved or for which the SOC may be significantly improved.",
        "start_character": 8095,
        "end_character": 8399
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-094159",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-094159-1b2f98665476e92e",
