        "filing_date": "2026-03-05",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We believe that developing a treatment for HEV, particularly a product candidate derived from our proprietary platform, is a potentially important and advantageous strategic expansion of our antiviral pipeline.",
